Step 7  →  disciplines.tsx + projects.tsx  (dark sections: #101820 bg, #0D1B2A cards)
Step 8  →  cta-banner.tsx  (sky blue CTA banner bg)
Step 9  →  footer.tsx  (#060D14 bg, light-sky text)
Step 10 →  Subpages  (about, services, work, why-choose-us, how-we-operate — fix hardcoded purples)
